    "description": "The Cinnabon app lets you place mobile orders for contactless delivery or pickup, earn points toward sweet rewards with every purchase, receive exclusive offers and more. Because Life Needs Frosting\u00ae.\r\n\r\nSweet Rewards\r\n---------------------\r\nEnjoy a 4-ct BonBites just for signing up!\r\nGet a 16 oz Cold Brew on your birthday\r\nEarn 10 points for every dollar spent\r\nReceive a Classic Roll, MiniBon or 4-ct BonBites every 250 points\r\nBonus offers and fun surprises\r\n\r\nGreat Features\r\n--------------------\r\nContactless mobile ordering for delivery or pickup\r\nExclusive rewards & offers\r\nConvenient bakery locator\r\nPoints tracker\r\n\r\nRewards and online ordering only available at participating U.S. locations. \r\n\r\nCA Privacy Notice: https://www.cinnabon.com/caprivacy \r\nDo Not Sell My Info: https://www.cinnabon.com/caprivacy#Ninth_Heading",
